    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Schizophrenic's Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Harry, a man tormented by schizophrenia and multiple personalities. Delusions and hallucinations twist his world and perspective, turning friends and neighbors into threats.\u00a0Harry\u2019s mind can\u2019t decide whether it wants help or total control.\u00a0<strong>Silent Residence</strong> is a psychological horror game about <strong>mental tension</strong>, <strong>identity</strong>, <strong>fear</strong>, and <strong>losing</strong> <strong>touch</strong> <strong>with</strong> <strong>reality</strong>. You must push on and fight your isolation with what's real. You can't give up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Psychological Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place taken in your apartment complex. The little details and your surrounding environment will feel the same, but they always have a frightening aspect to them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/915080d385af80d4df78e798e4a6380e.poster.avif?t=1755747423\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/915080d385af80d4df78e798e4a6380e.webm?t=1755747423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/915080d385af80d4df78e798e4a6380e.mp4?t=1755747423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NPC Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your neighbors and friends to narrate the story further. The people you live with can't be trusted. They always feel like a stranger to you, no matter how long you've known them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/8487384c48c2c51ef4adb23a39813c4a.poster.avif?t=1755747423\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/8487384c48c2c51ef4adb23a39813c4a.webm?t=1755747423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/8487384c48c2c51ef4adb23a39813c4a.mp4?t=1755747423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hallucinations &amp; Delusions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surrounding environments twist and change to simulate the horrors of schizophrenia. You never feel comfortable in one space. Keep moving and fight your delusions. You are nobody's isolation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/b5689a2486e82d7bea0c0dab8aa1ecad.poster.avif?t=1755747423\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/b5689a2486e82d7bea0c0dab8aa1ecad.webm?t=1755747423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813470/extras/b5689a2486e82d7bea0c0dab8aa1ecad.mp4?t=1755747423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
